  "details": "The camera has a focus mode that normally targets the area you point at.\n\nHowever, when you manually grab the camera and rotate it to face yourself, the focus detection position appears to be reversed left-to-right.\n\nThis issue occurs only when you rotate the camera by hand; using the flip button to reverse the image does not cause this problem.\n\nI prefer manually rotating the camera and do so frequently, but it is very confusing to have to point at the opposite side of what is displayed on my screen.",
